<title>USA: Japan PM Hashimoto arrives for U.S. visit.</title>
<headline>Japan PM Hashimoto arrives for U.S. visit.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto arrived on Thursday for talks with President Bill Clinton expected to focus on trade, security, and regional political issues.</p>
<p>The Clinton-Hashimoto meeting on Friday at the White House will be their fourth. The Japanese leader will also visit Congress and deliver a speech at the National Press Club.</p>
</text>
